  "description": "The Green of North Bend? Or maybe the Sanitas? Tried to get my heart rate up with high hiking cadence but no running - was able to hit aerobic threshold but no higher. 3rd class at top. Up to the end of the trail in 1:17, this would be a fun TT to workshop. No running on downhill. Can I train for UTMR on hiking and biking? Uphill hiking is great training but half the time hiking down doesn’t feel like much of a stimulus for anything.",
